{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HLuqAr7Q7gxAfwijrUk9hz","type":"tool_result","content":"# Farmers Markets Total by State\n\nBased on the data provided, here are the total farmers markets (from the `farmers_markets` column) for each U.S. state:\n\n**Top 10 States:**\n1. California: 647\n2. New York: 555\n3. Pennsylvania: 426\n4. Minnesota: 390\n5. Illinois: 370\n6. Virginia: 336\n7. Wisconsin: 335\n8. Michigan: 321\n9. Massachusetts: 273\n10. Florida: 246\n\n**U.S. Total (50 states + DC):** 9,424 farmers markets\n\nThis sum excludes Puerto Rico (2), Virgin Islands (0), and any other territories, as you requested, focusing only on the 50 states and the District of Columbia."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"999e277f-4166-4c0b-9928-fda2c57c0f86","uuid":"7c9e8dc7-39c2-451c-b0c5-c7d2761dd63b","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:07:21.694Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2651,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Farmers Markets Total by State\n\nBased on the data provided, here are the total farmers markets (from the `farmers_markets` column) for each U.S. state:\n\n**Top 10 States:**\n1. California: 647\n2. New York: 555\n3. Pennsylvania: 426\n4. Minnesota: 390\n5. Illinois: 370\n6. Virginia: 336\n7. Wisconsin: 335\n8. Michigan: 321\n9. Massachusetts: 273\n10. Florida: 246\n\n**U.S. Total (50 states + DC):** 9,424 farmers markets\n\nThis sum excludes Puerto Rico (2), Virgin Islands (0), and any other territories, as you requested, focusing only on the 50 states and the District of Columbia.","durationMs":2720,"url":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv"}}
